'''General GreGory''' (グレゴリー将軍, ''Guregorī Shōgun'', '''General GreGory''') is a [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Alien]] variant of [[Gory]] that appears in [[Cats of the Cosmos]] and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 6.5 Update|Version 6.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = General GreGory
|image = E 362.png
|first appearance = '''CotC''': [[Neptune (Cats of the Cosmos)|Chapter 1 - Neptune]]<br>'''SoL''': [[Offworld Weary|Sub-chapter 43 - Offworld Weary]]
|latest appearance = '''ZL''': [[Heartful Homunculus|Sub-chapter 13 - Heartful Homunculus]]
|money drop = 500¢ - 1,975¢
}}

==Enemy==
The Starred Alien version of [[Gory]] has much higher health and damage, along with more knockbacks, slightly longer range, and a [[Barrier]] with a breaking point of 6,000 damage. He moves at half the speed of [[Gory Dark]].

==Strategy==
Just like Gory's stronger variants, GreGory can make a dent in your defenses, especially if he appears in groups. The Barrier prevents General GreGory from being knocked back by the initial hit if the attacker doesn't have and activate [[:Category:Barrier Breaker Cats|Barrier Breaker]] (such as [[Fencer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fencer Cat]]). However, his weak Barrier means you don't specifically need one. Once that is taken care of, you can use [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Alien]] [[:Category:Crowd-Controller-class Cats|crowd-controllers]] like [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway Cat]] to stop or slow him so he's much easier to deal with.

