==Trivia==
*Since he's an [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]], General GreGory's name could be a reference to [[wikia:starwars:General Grievous|General Grievous]] from ''[[wikipedia:Star Wars|Star Wars]]''.
*Although his face is the same as the other [[Gory|Gories]], General GreGory's Japanese description says it is "fearsome", "terrible" or "dreadful" (恐ろしい) rather than just "scary" (コワイ).

